# Deny-by-default: this home directory accumulates dozens of tool configs,
# credential vaults, and session dumps over time (.ssh, .gnupg,
# .credential-vault, .diamond-keys, .openclaw/credentials, per-tool .env
# files, etc). A blocklist can't keep up with new tools appearing, so instead
# only the paths explicitly tracked in this repo are un-ignored below.
/*

# --- Allowlisted tracked top-level paths ---
# .config and .openclaw are shared tool-state dirs where almost everything
# else is unrelated config/credentials, so each directory level must be
# re-ignored (/dir/*) and only the specific tracked path re-allowed (!),
# rather than opening the whole subtree with a single !dir/** rule.
!/.config
/.config/*
!/.config/systemd
/.config/systemd/*
!/.config/systemd/user
/.config/systemd/user/*
!/.config/systemd/user/sota-stream-watchdog.service
!/.config/systemd/user/sota-stream-watchdog.timer

!/.github
/.github/*
!/.github/workflows
/.github/workflows/*
!/.github/workflows/openclaw-handoff.yml

!/.gitignore

!/.openclaw
/.openclaw/*
!/.openclaw/QUICKSTART.md
!/.openclaw/config.json
!/.openclaw/hooks
/.openclaw/hooks/*
!/.openclaw/hooks/pre-receive

!/DEPLOYMENT_SUMMARY.md
!/LICENSE
!/README.md
!/bin
!/bin/**
!/deploy-cloud.sh
!/directo
!/directo/**
!/genesis_conductor_engine
!/genesis_conductor_engine/**
!/load-env.sh
!/mirage-workspace
!/mirage-workspace/**
!/publish
!/publish/**
!/thermodynamic-daemon
!/thermodynamic-daemon/**
!/torx-sovereignty-agent
!/torx-sovereignty-agent/**

# --- Deny secret/credential-shaped files even inside allowlisted trees ---
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.env
**/*_env
**/*secret*
**/*credential*
**/*mnemonic*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/id_rsa
**/id_ed25519
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx

# --- Junk that can end up inside allowlisted trees ---
**/__pycache__/
**/node_modules/
**/.venv/
**/venv*/
**/*.log
**/*.swp
**/*~
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
